    <title>018-旅行| 仙境张家界不养闲人，古都大邑商屡变星霜</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666eac04b6a84127291a2f2a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666eac04b6a84127291a2f2a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 16 Jun 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天雪姨和三岛君来聊一聊五月末的两次旅行——张家界&amp;安阳，带你领略张家界的仙境奥秘和安阳的千古兴亡。张家界需要充分的行前攻略来应对它的复杂多元，而安阳则需要跟随历史的脚步，沉浸在文化遗产的浓厚氛围中。端午你去哪里旅游了么？欢迎您在评论中与我们分享——</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>内容提要——</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">00:02:02</a>:张家界，仙境之旅的不二选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2497">00:41:37</a>: 适老化无敌，张家界绝对适合带父母出游</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2997">00:49:57</a>: 魅力湘西：探索土家族婚嫁习俗与哭嫁文化之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3998">01:06:38</a>: 探秘古都安阳：殷商文明的辉煌与灭亡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5000">01:23:20</a>: 同样是美食荒漠：扁粉？烩菜？毫无吸引力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5498">01:31:38</a>: 化不开的乡愁：张家界很美，北京很大，而我的家乡却正在资源枯竭</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>照片给大家直观感受一下——</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>DAY01：第一天下雨，我们穿越仙境而来</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn1rvQtcZWx47szq2oacKHPsWTDi.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>DAY02：第二天晴天，终于看到了张家界地貌——石英砂岩岩柱</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv-vK-uQ5dnHrtQ-5XQVSX07VAMS.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>DAY03：第三天微雾，徒步最喜欢的金鞭溪</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgsKUNfFzfQxuiPQEY0QxbjfG_0l.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>DAY00：最后爆一张美丽的旅拍吧，变身红苗少女</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu9aNVA-eAhfopZ0Ftrdr5xA869H.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>主播：雪姨、33</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>嘉宾：三岛</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>剪辑制作：雪姨</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>BGM：《这条小鱼在乎》</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
